# Dithering Fights: four long arms sweeping around the centre, dividing the arena
# into pockets reached through gaps. Cyan-core walls with black rims.

NAME Dithering Fights
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS C K
START 10 10 SE

# Border: the top edge, completed by rotation.
MOVE 0 0
DRAW 31 0

# An arm from the top edge down towards the centre, then bending east.
MOVE 12 4
DRAW 12 12
DRAW 17 12

# A short baffle in the corner pocket.
MOVE 4 8
DRAW 7 8
